:: intro [story]
<p>Greetings, $activeCharacter!</p>
<p>Today is the first day of your Mergimals journey!</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Go see professor Tamrack.->start: part 1]]</li>
</ul>

:: start: part 1 [story]
<p>Professor Tamarack's office is on the Northeastern edge of town, inside the Mergimal Lab. It's the biggest building in the village and what mysteries fill all three floors are as good as anyone's guess. As you walk towards the front door, the professor steps out of it and greets you with a warm smile.</p>
<<tam>>$activeCharacter!<br />
Finally, you’re here!
<</tam>>
<div id='response'>
  <<link 'Say: Were you waiting for me?'>>
    <<replace '#response'>>
      <<say $activeCharacter $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].portrait>>Were you waiting for me?<</say>>
      <<tam>>No, I wasn’t waiting at the window all morning for you.<br />
        <<cont keypress append>>I have, um, lots and lots of work to do to keep me busy.<br />
          <<cont keypress append>>I’m, like, super duper busy.<br />
            <<cont keypress append>>So, please… come inside and we'll get you set up.<br />
              <<cont keypress append>>You’ve been waiting 10 years for this, how exciting!<br />
                <<cont keypress>><<replace '#link'>><<link 'Follow the professor inside the Lab.' 'start: part 2'>><</link>><</replace>>
                <</cont>>
              <</cont>>
            <</cont>>
          <</cont>>
        <</cont>>
              <</tam>>
              @@#link;@@
    <</replace>>
  <</link>>
  <ul class='choices'>
    <li>
      <<link 'Say: Let\'s go!'>>
        <<replace '#response'>>
          <<say $activeCharacter $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].portrait>>Let's go!<</say>>
          <<tam>>You’ve been waiting 10 years for this, how exciting!<</tam>>
          <<link 'Follow the professor inside the Lab.' 'start: part 2'>><</link>>
        <</replace>>
      <</link>>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

:: start: part 2 [story]
<p>You enter.</p>
<p>It's time to pick your first Mergimal!</p>
<div style='display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>
  <<card 'melodrake' true>>
  <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].mergipedia.melodrake = 'seen'>>
  <<card 'scorchilla' true>>
  <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].mergipedia.scorchilla = 'seen'>>
  <<card 'penguwaiian' true>>
  <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].mergipedia.penguwaiian = 'seen'>>
</div>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Ask if there are any others.->start: part 2b]]</li>
</ul>

:: start: part 2b [story]
<p>Maybe someday! But not right now.</p>
<p>So make a choice.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[As you wish.->start: part 2]]</li>
</ul>

:: start: part 3 [story]
<<set _starter = $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].starter>>
<<tam>>So, you chose the <span class='text-red'>$mergimals[_starter].type</span> Mergimal _starter?<br />
They seem quite strong.<</tam>>
<<set _starterEntry = 'I chose a ' + _starter + ' as my first Mergimal.'>>
<<writeentry _starterEntry>>
<<tam>>You are now ready to set out and take on the Mergimal School Challenge!<br />
Your first stop is in Littlemoose, at the Veil School.<</tam>>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[I understand.->start: part 4]]</li>
</ul>

:: start: part 4 [story]
<<tam>>Since you're already headed towards Littlemoose, will you do me a favor?<br />
I owe the Veil School leader, Grace, some Mergiballs. Can you give them these?<</tam>>
<div class='new-items'><strong>GAIN:</strong> 5 mergiballs.</div>
<<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].backpack.mergiball += 5>>
<<writeentry 'I was asked to make a delivery to the Veil School leader.'>>
<<tam>>I am sure Grace wouldn't mind if you used a few on your way there.<</tam>>
<p>It's time to start your journey.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Let's go!->b3]]</li>
  <li>[[Can you explain where Littlemoose is?->start: part 4b]]</li>
</ul>

:: start: part 4b [story]
<<tam>>You'll find it to the south and east, just on the other side of Littlemoose Forest.<br />
Make sure to use your map if you get lost.<</tam>>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Okay, I am ready!->b3]]</li>
</ul>